## 5. Update the success result HTML building (find the section where `data.allowed` is true and result HTML is built):

After the existing ETA row (`if (cfg.showEta && data.eta)`), add:

```javascript
// Delivery Date
if (cfg.showDeliveryDate && data.estimatedDeliveryDate) {
  var dateStr = formatDeliveryDate(data.estimatedDeliveryDate);
  if (dateStr) {
    html += '<div class="zcc-meta zcc-delivery-date">' + ICONS.calendar + '<span>Expected by <strong>' + esc(dateStr) + '</strong></span></div>';
  }
}
```

After the existing cutoff time row (`if (cfg.showCutoffTime && data.cutoffTime)`), add:

```javascript
// Countdown Timer
if (cfg.showCountdown && data.cutoffTime) {
  html += buildCountdownHtml(data.cutoffTime, wid);
}
```

After the existing COD section but before return policy, add:

```javascript
// Delivery Fee
if (cfg.showDeliveryFee !== false) {
  if (data.deliveryFee === 0 || data.deliveryFee === null) {
    html += '<div class="zcc-delivery-fee zcc-delivery-fee--free">' + ICONS.truck + ' Free Delivery</div>';
  } else if (data.deliveryFee != null && data.deliveryFee > 0) {
    html += '<div class="zcc-delivery-fee zcc-delivery-fee--paid">' + ICONS.truck + ' Delivery: $' + data.deliveryFee.toFixed(2) + '</div>';
  }
  if (data.freeShippingAbove != null && data.freeShippingAbove > 0 && (data.deliveryFee == null || data.deliveryFee > 0)) {
    html += '<div class="zcc-meta" style="margin-top:3px !important"><span style="font-size:11px !important;color:#6d7175 !important">Free delivery on orders over $' + data.freeShippingAbove.toFixed(2) + '</span></div>';
  }
}
```

## 6. After `res.innerHTML = html;` for the success case, start the countdown updater:

```javascript
if (cfg.showCountdown && data.cutoffTime) {
  startCountdownUpdater(wid, data.cutoffTime);
}
```

After making all changes, run `npm run typecheck` from `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/Pinzo`.

